    - target: {fileID: 4624742119251543058, guid: b13f3e53e0a2edf419a45d0facc62227, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "There once was a prosperous kingdom offering all in need shelter and
        protection. It was well guarded, it\u2019s sturdy walls keeping out any danger
        that dared to approach. Townsfolk murmured that nothing could make this kingdom
        fall.\n\nHowever, one fateful night, citizens started to not wake from slumber.
        A mysterious sickness spread within the kingdom\u2018s walls and more and
        more poor souls fell victim to it. The king ordered for everyone to stay
        home to keep them save, yet some refused to stay at bay and sought to tend
        to the sick.."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
